The first column is the bonus for small/medium creatures, the second is for
large creatures.  Thus, Cleaver does +1 on small/medium and +2 on large
creatures.

Demonbane does +5 on small demons, and double damage on large.  If there is a
monster in the second to last column, then the bonuses only apply to that
group of monsters.
